# Digital Collections, Digital Libraries &amp; the Digitization of Cultural Heritage Information.

**Authors:** Lynch, Clifford

## Abstract
Discusses digital collections and digital libraries. Topics include broadband availability; digital rights protection; content, both non-profit and commercial; digitization of cultural content; sustainability; metadata harvesting protocol; infrastructure; authorship; linking multiple resources; data mining; digitization of reference works; personal collections of digital materials; and cultural heritage collections. (LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ664850

